docs {
  The vault read path and folders: server config, sync, equivalent domains,
  collections and folder changes. Every official client runs these on start.

  `GET /sync` is not in the coverage report: the client builds its path in a
  variable (`/sync` or `/sync?excludeDomains=true`), which the extraction did
  not follow.
}
